          "flirScript": null,
          "flirCode": "fun onCollide(other) begincode\n  $$ se colide com obstaculo, respawn\n  if (other == inst_obstacle_1) begincode\n    respawnAtCheckpoint()\n  endcode\n  if (other == inst_obstacle_2) begincode\n    respawnAtCheckpoint()\n  endcode\nendcode\n\nfun onTick(deltaTime) begincode\n  $$ verificar se caiu da plataforma\n  if (getVar(\"_y_pos\") < -10) begincode\n    respawnAtCheckpoint()\n  endcode\n  setVar(\"_y_pos\", 0)\nendcode"
