          "type": "TextObject",
          "name": "Texto Cristais",
          "position": [50, 8],
          "rotation": [0, 0, 0],
          "scale": [1, 1, 1],
          "visible": true,
          "text": "Cristais: 0 / 3",
          "color": "#ffffff",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "align": "center",
          "flirScript": null,
          "flirCode": "fun onTick(deltaTime) begincode\n  var c1 = getInventoryCount(\"Cristal Azul\")\n  var c2 = getInventoryCount(\"Cristal Verde\")\n  var c3 = getInventoryCount(\"Cristal Roxo\")\n  var total = c1 + c2 + c3\n  setUIValue(\"Texto Cristais\", \"Cristais: \" + total + \" / 3\")\n  if (total == 3) begincode\n    setUIValue(\"Texto Cristais\", \"Todos os cristais colectados!\")\n  endcode\nendcode"
        },
