          "currentState": "playing",
          "flirScript": null,
          "flirCode": "fun beginPlay() begincode\n  setGameState(\"playing\")\n  setVar(\"_y_pos\", 0)\n  setVar(\"_level_time\", 120)\n  print(\"FlirQuest iniciado!\")\n  print(\"Colecta os 3 cristais e chega ao portal!\")\nendcode\n\nfun onGameStateChange(state) begincode\n  if (state == \"gameover\") begincode\n    print(\"Game Over! Respawn...\")\n    respawnAtCheckpoint()\n    setGameState(\"playing\")\n  endcode\nendcode"
